⭐ Interview Tip

The expected interview solution is the Monotonic Decreasing Stack. The key optimization is storing both the stock price and its computed span. When a smaller or equal price is popped, its entire span is added to the current span in one step, ensuring each price is processed only once and giving an amortized O(1) time complexity per next() call.
